# FUTURE_DS_01
## Task Name
## Objective
The objective of this project is to analyze Superstore sales data and create an interactive Power BI dashboard to understand sales performance, profit trends, customer segments, and regional performance.
## Tools Used
* Power BI
* Superstore Sales Dataset
## Dataset Overview
The dataset contains information about:
* Sales
* Profit
* Orders
* Customer Segments
* Product Categories
* Regions and States
* Shipping Details
## Dashboard Features
* Total Sales Overview
* Total Profit Analysis
* Sales by Region
* Sales by Category and Sub-Category
* Customer Segment Analysis
* Monthly Sales Trends
* Top Performing Products
* Profitability Insights
## Key Insights
* Identified regions with the highest sales performance.
* Compared profit generated across different product categories.
* Analyzed customer segments contributing most to revenue.
* Tracked monthly sales trends to identify seasonal patterns.
* Highlighted top-performing products and business opportunities.
## Files Included
* Superstore Sales Dashboard.pbix
## Conclusion

This dashboard provides valuable insights into business performance and helps stakeholders make data-driven decisions regarding sales strategy, customer targeting, and product management.
